Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Audio ducking off — stops Windows dropping game audio 80% on voice chat
; Source: Peterbot Delay8.reg (the only GOOD file in that pack)
; Independently confirmed by MaxxTopia efficacy audit (KEEP-CORE tier)
; Registry: HKCU\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Multimedia\Audio\UserDuckingPreference
; Value 3 = ducking disabled. Default 0 = Windows controls ducking.
; Revert: set back to 0

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Multimedia\Audio]
"UserDuckingPreference"=dword:00000003
